<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 738-3 AT LUNCH ON FIFTH DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 738-3 AT LUNCH ON FIFTH DAY.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, replying to India's first innings total of 537 for 8 declared, were 738 for three at lunch on the fifth and final day of the first test in Colombo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 decl; Sri Lanka 738-3 (S.Jayasuriya 340, R.Mahanama 225, A.de Silva not out 53, A.Ranatunga not out 65.</p>
